OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe clear spells through the evening
OL,7,Fand overnight with a few showers
OL,8,Fpossible. Breezy at times around
OL,9,Fnorthern coasts and a chilly night
OL,10,Ffurther inland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,13,Fthe day with just the odd shower
OL,14,Fpossible, staying mostly dry in the
OL,15,Fsoutheast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
